# Slim repo: only files the n8n review-loop workflow needs are tracked.
# Everything else in this workspace stays untracked on disk.
*
!.gitignore
!bookplatform/
!factories/
!tools/
!tools/puzzle_qc/
!tools/puzzle_qc/**
!projects/
!projects/mystery_logic_puzzle/
!projects/mystery_logic_puzzle/**
!n8n/
!pilot_book_spec.json
!.devin/
!.devin/skills/
!.devin/skills/**
nul
__pycache__/
*.pyc
n8n/browser_profile/
n8n/audit/
